{"ts":"2026-08-11T05:03:52.795Z","author":"pi-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.2:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"f5a6c492255e087dcf4ddaf7","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.2:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":{"value":"pm-rl-cnc0","source":"argv"}},"op":"learning_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-11T05:03:52.795Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/learnings","value":[{"created_at":"2026-08-11T05:03:52.795Z","author":"pi-agent","text":"A read-then-write budget check is racy exactly when the caller promotes programmatically (a recursive loop); an atomic claim on the authorization item serializes the count and the write. The pm SDK's isAlreadyClaimedError was not a public export in this version; the stable already_claimed_by context code is the equivalent structural predicate."}]}],"before_hash":"0e94b63291dab6f30f7d0c679a4afb79d375df136ea9e952daac6c7becc3197a","after_hash":"125222bf3c35e3280cd083daf85db2ae9c1e6c7b29de9c60397478c63f897cae"}
